- op: discuss  # e680
  at: '2026-05-30T09:06:42Z'  # e680
  by: agent  # e680
  actor: jgstern_agent  # e680
  clock: 4  # e680
  nonce: e680  # e680
  message: "Cross-ref backfill (2026-05-30, deeper-issue investigation): completes the override contract that WI-votan (done) opened by adding extra_catalogs.sources to the claims schema — the schema landed but cli.py:4431 collapses claims-file extras and CLI extras into one user layer before load_taint_catalog (taint.py:437-477), and _merge_with_user_override only dedups between auto and user, never within. Sibling fail-silent of INV-nufob (--taint-* flags silently accept nonexistent files) and member of umbrella INV-fabov. Structural fix shape: reify the third \"claims-file extras\" layer and call _merge_with_user_override once between claims-file and CLI before merging against built-in."  # e680
